# EnrollGen AI Copilot — Supabase Architecture

## Overview

Supabase Postgres + pgvector powers a searchable knowledge base of transcribed enrollment calls. EnrollGen's AI copilot queries this at runtime to surface relevant reference material for agents mid-call.

**Data flow:**
```
Call Recording (Conversely/QA)
  → Transcription (Whisper API)
  → Chunking + Embedding (OpenAI/Anthropic)
  → Supabase (Postgres + pgvector)
  → EnrollGen Copilot (semantic search → context injection)
```

