## 2. Topic Taxonomy

Standardized topic tags for chunking. Use these during ingestion to tag each chunk:

| Tag | Description |
|-----|-------------|
| `scope_of_appointment` | SOA confirmation, CMS-required disclosures |
| `plan_benefits` | Explaining plan features, copays, formulary |
| `eligibility_verification` | Medicare/Medicaid status, LIS, Part A/B dates |
| `enrollment_process` | Walking through enrollment steps, Sunfire |
| `objection_handling` | Responding to hesitation or pushback |
| `sep_qualification` | Verifying Special Enrollment Period eligibility |
| `comparison` | Comparing plans side by side |
| `compliance_disclosure` | Required disclaimers, recording notices |
| `prescription_review` | Drug list, pharmacy preferences |
| `provider_check` | Doctor/specialist network lookup |
| `premium_cost` | Monthly cost, Part B giveback, IRMAA |
| `closing` | Confirmation, recap, next steps |
| `warm_transfer` | Handoff language, transfer protocols |

